@local/dsh-plugin-deepseek-web README · DeepSeek Web (DSH plugin)：[**简体中文**](README.zh-CN.md) · English

Two controls, one purpose: keep DeepSeek's web chat and your DSH Session in the
same window.

@local/dsh-plugin-deepseek-web README · Install：Manual alternative: add `"@local/dsh-plugin-deepseek-web": "link:C:/path/to/deepseek-web-panel"`
to your profile's `package.json`, list the package under `dsh.profile.bundles`,
and install; `cordis.patch.yml` is the row this bundle inserts.

@local/dsh-plugin-deepseek-web README · Through a plugin market：The jsDelivr mirrors are listed first because `raw.githubusercontent.com` is
unreachable from some networks; the Host fetches the index itself, so pick one it
can reach.

@local/dsh-plugin-deepseek-web README · Through a plugin market：Requirements: DSH Desktop (Electron) on Windows, macOS or Linux. The sign-in
patch targets the desktop `app.asar`; a DSH upgrade replaces that file, which the
status dot then reports.

@local/dsh-plugin-deepseek-web README · Settings：Settings → **DeepSeek web chat** holds this plugin's preferences. They are
stored per browser profile (`dsh.deepseek-web.settings.v1`) and apply live — the
dot on the sidebar updates as you change them, without a reload.

@local/dsh-plugin-deepseek-web README · Settings："Restore defaults" resets every value above. Every preference is written to
local storage, so a fresh install starts from the defaults and a broken stored
value falls back to them.

@local/dsh-plugin-deepseek-web README · Drag and drop into the web chat：When nothing resolves, the bar says so and copies the pressed element's shape
(tag, class, and its `title`/`href`/`aria-*`) to the clipboard, which is the
fastest way to report a surface the bridge does not recognize yet.

@local/dsh-plugin-deepseek-web README · Review bridge：1. the tool queues one request (single flight: a second call while one runs is
   rejected) and awaits the answer;
2. the Client polls `GET /deepseek-web/review/task` every 1.2 s;
3. on a new request it opens a **dedicated DeepSeek tab** (never the
   conversation the user is having), waits for the composer, types, and sends;
4. it polls the page until the answer stops growing (message count or body
   length stops changing, no stop control visible), then extracts the text;
5. it posts the answer to `POST /deepseek-web/review/result`, which resolves the
   waiting tool call.

@local/dsh-plugin-deepseek-web README · Persistent sign-in: the partition patch：Desktop creates the sidebar browser's storage partition in exactly one place
(`DesktopBrowserGuests.acquire` in the shell's main process):

```js
let partition = this.partitions.get(workspace);
if (partition === void 0) {
  partition = `dsh-sidebar-browser-${randomUUID()}`;
  this.configureSession(session.fromPartition(partition));

@local/dsh-plugin-deepseek-web README · Persistent sign-in: the partition patch：So the fix lives outside the plugin. `tools/apply-persist-patch.mjs` rewrites
that one statement in place, with a replacement of **exactly the same 50 bytes**
so no asar header, offset, or file table changes:

```diff
- partition = `dsh-sidebar-browser-${randomUUID()}`;
+ partition="persist:"+workspace.replace(/\W/g, "");
```

@local/dsh-plugin-deepseek-web README · Why it reuses the Browser tab：In the browser build of DSH the same tab type falls back to an iframe and no
guest exists, so both controls report that embedded browsing is unavailable
instead of failing silently.

@local/dsh-plugin-deepseek-web README · 已知限制：- DeepSeek 页面一改版，审查链路的 DOM 定位（输入框、发送控件、答案块）可能失效；失败时错误信息里会带诊断快照，便于重新定位；
- 会话目录取自"当前可见会话"，并排多会话时会用最后发布的那个；解析不到相对路径时会退化为按文件名查找，行为是拒绝而不是读错文件；
- 多开几个 DeepSeek 标签且都不可见时，拖拽和拉取会拒绝猜测目标。
